guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ HN supi Sqn sqn_root count #i.
  (Sqn_HSS_Invariance( HN, supi, Sqn, sqn_root, count ) @ #i)
 ∧
  ∀ #j. (Sqn_Create( supi, HN, sqn_root ) @ #j) ⇒ ¬(#j < #i)"
*/
