    (Sqn_UE_Nochange( supi, HN, Sqni ) @ #i)
   ∧
    (#i < #j) ∧ (¬(Sqnj = Sqni)) ∧ (∀ dif. (Sqnj = (Sqni++dif)) ⇒ ⊥)))"
*/
by sorry

